<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ireland's NTMA says 5-yr bond tap issue all sold.</title>
<headline>Ireland's NTMA says 5-yr bond tap issue all sold.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) said on Tuesday that a 100 million punt tap issue in the 6.5 percent bond due 2001 was closed and all 100 million punts had been sold.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
